📣 Announcing the immediate availability of:

- PHP 8.2.35
- PHP 8.3.36
- PHP 8.4.27
- PHP 8.5.12

‼️ These address the following critical security issues:

- Remote Code Execution via Out of Memory corruption (CVE-2026-109618)
- Remote Code Execution via Stale Global State (CVE-2026-109619)

